        " \"إِذَا كَانَ اَلَّذِي يُنَاوِلُكَ اَلْمَاءَ مَمْلُوكاً لَكَ فَاشْرَبْ فِي ثَلاَثَةِ أَنْفَاسٍ وَ إِنْ كَانَ حُرّاً فَاشْرَبْهُ بِنَفَسٍ وَاحِدٍ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4245 - One of his companions asked him about drinking water in a single breath.\nImam (as) said: \"If the person handing you the water is your servant, then drink it in three breaths; but if he is free, then drink it in a single breath.\""
        ]
      }
